<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Air Products, Praxair cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Air Products, Praxair cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Schroder Wertheim said it downgraded Air Products and Chemicals Inc and Praxair Inc to &quot;outperform&quot; from &quot;outperform significantly.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Air Products was off 5/8 at 75-3/4 and Praxair dipped 1-3/4 to 50-1/8.</p>
</text>
